{# Quickstart #}
<section class="section border-t border-border">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6" data-animate="fade-up">Quickstart</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-8" data-animate="fade-up">Clone, build, and compile your first intent in under 5 minutes.</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6" data-animate="fade-up">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-medium text-foreground mb-3">1. Clone & Build</h3>
        <pre><code class="language-bash">git clone https://github.com/paxlabs-inc/matrix-core.git
cd matrix-core
make build && make install</code></pre>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-medium text-foreground mb-3">2. Compile an Intent</h3>
        <pre><code class="language-bash">./bin/mclc compile \
  -skill skills/writing-plans/SKILL.mtx \
  -prose "Build a deployment pipeline for my Node.js app" \
  -verb build</code></pre>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-medium text-foreground mb-3">3. Run a Walk</h3>
        <pre><code class="language-bash">./bin/mcl-execute walk \
  -prose "Summarise the README and write it to /tmp/summary.md" \
  -manifest agents/default.json \
  -cortex-root ./runs/dev-cortex \
  -skills-root ./skills</code></pre>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-medium text-foreground mb-3">4. Start the Daemon</h3>
        <pre><code class="language-bash">./bin/mcl-execute daemon \
  -addr :8080 \
  -cortex-root ./runs/dev-cortex \
  -manifest agents/default.json \
  -skills-root ./skills</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

